#: ../../iam/password-management/policies.rst:118
msgid ""
"Write the password to a file to avoid leaking it to the command history. "
"The example uses the file :file:`password.txt`."
msgstr ""
"Schreiben Sie das Passwort in eine Datei, um zu vermeiden, dass es in die"
