#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:204
msgid "User registration"
msgstr "Benutzer-Registrierung"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:206
msgid ""
"The *End User Self Service* allows users to register themselves. The "
"registration creates a user account that the user must verify through "
"email."
msgstr ""
"Der *End User Self Service* ermöglicht es Benutzern, sich selbst zu "
"registrieren. Die Registrierung erstellt ein Benutzerkonto, das der "
"Benutzer per E-Mail verifizieren muss."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:212
msgid ":external+uv-nubus-manual:ref:`nubus-user-management-user-registration`"
msgstr ":external+uv-nubus-manual:ref:`nubus-user-management-user-registration`"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:213
msgid ""
"in :cite:t:`uv-nubus-manual` for information about using the self-"
"registration."
msgstr ""
"im :cite:t:`uv-nubus-manual` für Informationen zur Verwendung der "
"Selbstregistrierung."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:219
msgid "Registration form"
msgstr "Registrierungsformular"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:221
msgid ""
"You can configure properties of the *Create an account* page and the "
"account creation itself with the following Univention Configuration "
"Registry (UCR) variables."
msgstr ""
"Sie können die Eigenschaften der Seite *Konto erstellen* und die "
"Kontoerstellung selbst mit den folgenden Univention Configuration "
"Registry (UCR)-Variablen konfigurieren."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:227
#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:310
#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:387
msgid ""
"You need to set these UCR variables on the Nubus for UCS system that "
"provides :program:`Self Service Backend` as defined in the UCR variable "
":envvar:`self-service/backend-server`, because the self-service "
"registration forwards requests to the Self Service backend."
msgstr ""
"Sie müssen diese UCR-Variablen auf dem Nubus für UCS System setzen, das "
":program:`Self Service Backend` über die UCR-Variable :envvar:`self-"
"service/backend-server` definiert hat, da die Selbstservice-Registrierung"
" Anfragen an das Self Service Backend weiterleitet."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:234
msgid "Activates the backend functionality for account creation."
msgstr "Aktiviert die Backend-Funktionalität für die Kontoerstellung."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:236
#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:396
msgid "``false``"
msgstr "``false``"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:241
msgid ""
"Defines the DN of the user template that the *Self Service* uses to "
"create an account through the *Create an account* page."
msgstr ""
"Definiert den DN der Benutzervorlage, die der *Self Service* verwendet, "
"um ein Konto über die Seite *Konto erstellen* zu erstellen."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:245
msgid ""
"If the variable has no value, the *Self Service* doesn't use a user "
"template."
msgstr ""
"Wenn die Variable keinen Wert hat, verwendet der *Self Service* keine "
"Benutzervorlage."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:248
msgid ""
"For information about user account templates, see :external+uv-nubus-"
"manual:ref:`nubus-user-templates` in :cite:t:`uv-nubus-manual`."
msgstr ""
"Für Informationen zu Benutzerkonto-Vorlagen siehe :external+uv-nubus-"
"manual:ref:`nubus-user-templates` im :cite:t:`uv-nubus-manual`."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:257
msgid ""
"Defines the DN of the container in the directory service where the *Self "
"Service* stores the user account objects created through the *Create an "
"account* page."
msgstr ""
"Definiert den DN des Containers im Verzeichnisdienst, in dem der *Self "
"Service* die über die Seite *Konto erstellen* erstellten Objekte für "
"Benutzerkonten speichert."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:263
msgid ""
"If the variable has no value, the *Self Service* uses the default "
"container ``cn=self registered users,$ldap_base`` for user account "
"objects."
msgstr ""
"Wenn die Variable keinen Wert hat, verwendet der *Self Service* den "
"Standard-Container ``cn=self registered users,$ldap_base`` für "
"Benutzerkonto-Objekte."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:273
msgid ""
"Defines a comma-separated list of UDM attributes that the *Self Service* "
"shows on the *Create an account* page."
msgstr ""
"Definiert eine kommagetrennte Liste von UDM Attributen, die der *Self "
"Service* auf der Seite *Konto erstellen* anzeigt."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:281
msgid ""
"Defines the UDM attributes as a comma-separated list of strings that the "
"*Self Service* marks as required on the *Create an account* page. The UCR"
" variable :envvar:`umc/self-service/account-registration/udm_attributes` "
"must include the UDM attributes."
msgstr ""
"Definiert die UDM Attribute als kommagetrennte Liste von Zeichenketten, "
"die der *Self Service* auf der Seite *Konto erstellen* als erforderlich "
"kennzeichnet. Die UCR-Variable :envvar:`umc/self-service/account-"
"registration/udm_attributes` muss die UDM Attribute enthalten."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:293
msgid "Email verification"
msgstr "E-Mail-Verifizierung"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:295
msgid ""
"When users register through the *Self Service*, they receive a "
"verification email with a token to confirm their email address. This "
"section describes how to configure the verification email and token "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"Wenn sich Benutzer über den *Self Service* registrieren, erhalten sie "
"eine E-Mail zur Verifizierung mit einem Token, um ihre E-Mailadresse zu "
"bestätigen. Dieser Abschnitt beschreibt die Konfiguration der E-Mail zur "
"Verifizierung und Token-Eigenschaften."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:301
msgid ""
"You can configure properties of the *verification email* and of the "
"verification token through the following Univention Configuration "
"Registry variables. For information about the verification process, see "
":external+uv-nubus-manual:ref:`nubus-user-management-user-registration-"
"email-verification` in :cite:t:`uv-nubus-manual`."
msgstr ""
"Sie können die Eigenschaften der *E-Mail zur Verifizierung* und des "
"Tokens über die folgenden Univention Configuration Registry-Variablen "
"konfigurieren. Für Informationen zum Verifizierungsprozess siehe "
":external+uv-nubus-manual:ref:`nubus-user-management-user-registration-"
"email-verification` im :cite:t:`uv-nubus-manual`."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:317
msgid ""
"Defines the ``host`` part to use in the verification URL. The default "
"value uses the fully qualified domain name of the :program:`Self Service "
"Backend` as defined through the UCR variable :envvar:`self-service"
"/backend-server`."
msgstr ""
"Definiert den ``host``-Teil für den Link zur Verifizierung. Der "
"Standardwert verwendet den vollständig qualifizierten Domänennamen des "
":program:`Self Service Backend`, wie durch die UCR-Variable :envvar"
":`self-service/backend-server` definiert."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:323
msgid "fully qualified domain name of the :program:`Self Service Backend`"
msgstr "Vollständig qualifizierter Domänenname des :program:`Self Service Backend`"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:328
msgid "Defines the sender address of the verification email."
msgstr "Definiert die Absenderadresse der E-Mail für die Verifizierung."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:330
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":samp:`Account Verification Service <noreply@{FQDN}>`"
msgstr ":samp:`Account Verification Service <noreply@{FQDN}>`"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:335
msgid "Defines the server name or IP address of the mail server to use."
msgstr ""
"Definiert den Servernamen oder die IP-Adresse des zu verwendenden Mail-"
"Servers."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:337
msgid "``localhost``"
msgstr "``localhost``"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:342
msgid ""
"Defines the path to a text file that the *Self Service* uses for the text"
