":external+uv-nubus-manual:ref:`nubus-user-management-user-registration-"
"account-activation` im :cite:t:`uv-nubus-manual`."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:383
msgid ""
"This section provides information about how to configure the account "
"verification."
msgstr ""
"Dieser Abschnitt bietet Informationen zur Konfiguration der Konto-"
