#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:421
msgid "User deregistration"
msgstr "Benutzer-Abmeldung"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:423
msgid ""
"The :program:`Self Service` allows users to request the deletion of their"
" user account."
msgstr ""
"Der :program:`Self Service` ermöglicht es Benutzern, die Löschung ihres "
"Benutzerkontos anzufordern."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:429
msgid "Deregistration request"
msgstr "Anfrage zur Abmeldung"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:431
msgid ""
"If a user requests to delete their account, Nubus doesn't delete the user"
" account directly, but deactivates it. If the user has a "
"``PasswordRecoveryEmail`` defined, Nubus sends a notification email. In "
"addition, Nubus sets the following attributes of the user account:"
msgstr ""
"Wenn ein Benutzer die Löschung seines Kontos anfordert, löscht Nubus das "
"Benutzerkonto nicht direkt, sondern deaktiviert es. Wenn der Benutzer "
"eine ``PasswordRecoveryEmail`` definiert hat, benachrichtigt Nubus den "
"Benutzer über E-Mail. Zusätzlich setzt Nubus die folgenden Attribute des "
"Benutzerkontos:"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:439
msgid "``DeregisteredThroughSelfService`` to ``TRUE``"
msgstr "``DeregisteredThroughSelfService`` auf ``TRUE``"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:440
msgid ""
"``DeregistrationTimestamp`` to the current time in the `GeneralizedTime "
"LDAP syntax <ldap-generalized-time_>`_."
msgstr ""
"``DeregistrationTimestamp`` zur aktuellen Zeit in der `GeneralizedTime "
"LDAP-Syntax <ldap-generalized-time_>`_."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:442
msgid "Use the following UCR variables to configure user self-deregistration."
msgstr ""
"Verwenden Sie die folgenden UCR-Variablen, um die Abmeldung des eigenen "
"Kontos durch Benutzer zu konfigurieren."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:446
msgid ""
"Activates the *Delete my account* button on the *Your profile* page of "
"the *Self Service*."
msgstr ""
"Aktiviert die Schaltfläche *Mein Konto löschen* auf der Seite *Mein "
"Profil* des *Self Service*."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:454
msgid ""
"Defines the sender address of the notification email about a user account"
" deletion request."
msgstr ""
"Definiert die Absenderadresse der E-Mail zur Benachrichtigung über eine "
"Anfrage zur Löschung eines Benutzerkontos."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:457
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":samp:`Password Reset Service <noreply@{FQDN}>`"
msgstr ":samp:`Password Reset Service <noreply@{FQDN}>`"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:462
msgid ""
"Defines the server name as fully qualified domain name or IP address of "
"the mail server for sending the notification email about a user account "
"deletion request."
msgstr ""
"Definiert den Servernamen als vollständig qualifizierten Domänennamen "
"oder IP-Adresse des Mail-Servers zum Senden der E-Mail zur "
"Benachrichtigung über eine Anfrage zur Löschung eines Benutzerkontos."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:471
msgid ""
"Defines the path to a text file that the *Self Service* uses for the text"
" body of the notification email. The text can contain the following "
"strings. The *Self Service* substitutes them accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Definiert den Pfad zu einer Textdatei, die der *Self Service* für den "
"Textinhalt der E-Mail zur Benachrichtigung verwendet. Der Text kann die "
"folgenden Zeichenketten enthalten. Der *Self Service* ersetzt sie "
"entsprechend."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:479
msgid ""
":file:`/usr/share/univention-self-"
"service/email_bodies/deregistration_notification_email_body.txt`"
msgstr ""
":file:`/usr/share/univention-self-"
"service/email_bodies/deregistration_notification_email_body.txt`"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:485
msgid "Account cleanup"
msgstr "Konto-Bereinigung"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:487
msgid ""
"The *Self Service* provides a script at :file:`/usr/share/univention-"
"self-service/delete_deregistered_accounts.py` that you can use to delete "
"all ``users/user`` objects that have the "
"``DeregisteredThroughSelfService`` attribute set to ``TRUE`` and whose "
"``DeregistrationTimestamp`` attribute is older than a specified time."
msgstr ""
"Der *Self Service* bietet ein Skript unter :file:`/usr/share/univention-"
"self-service/delete_deregistered_accounts.py`, das Sie verwenden können, "
"um alle ``users/user``-Objekte zu löschen, bei denen das Attribut "
"``DeregisteredThroughSelfService`` auf ``TRUE`` gesetzt ist und deren "
"Attribut ``DeregistrationTimestamp`` älter als eine angegebene Zeit ist."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:497
msgid "Manually delete de-registered user accounts"
msgstr "Manuell abgemeldete Benutzerkonten löschen"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:498
msgid ""
"The command in :numref:`end-user-self-service-deregistration-delete-"
"listing` deletes user accounts whose ``DeregistrationTimestamp`` is older"
" than 5 days and 2 hours."
msgstr ""
"Der Befehl in :numref:`end-user-self-service-deregistration-delete-"
"listing` löscht Benutzerkonten, deren ``DeregistrationTimestamp`` älter "
"als 5 Tage und 2 Stunden ist."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:501
msgid "Example for deleting de-registered and deactivated user accounts"
msgstr "Beispiel zum Löschen abgemeldeter und deaktivierter Benutzerkonten"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:501
msgid ""
"$ /usr/share/univention-self-service/delete_deregistered_accounts.py \\\n"
"  --timedelta-days 5 \\\n"
"  --timedelta-hours 2"
msgstr ""
"$ /usr/share/univention-self-service/delete_deregistered_accounts.py \\\n"
"  --timedelta-days 5 \\\n"
"  --timedelta-hours 2"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:511
msgid "Script arguments"
msgstr "Skript-Argumente"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:512
msgid ""
"For the possible arguments of the script, see :numref:`end-user-self-"
"service-deregistration-script-arguments-listing`."
msgstr ""
"Für die möglichen Argumente des Skripts siehe :numref:`end-user-self-"
"service-deregistration-script-arguments-listing`."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:515
msgid "Available arguments for :file:`delete_deregistered_accounts.py`"
msgstr "Verfügbare Argumente für :file:`delete_deregistered_accounts.py`"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:515
msgid ""
"$ /usr/share/univention-self-service/delete_deregistered_accounts.py "
"--help"
msgstr ""
"$ /usr/share/univention-self-service/delete_deregistered_accounts.py "
"--help"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:523
msgid "Scheduled deletion of de-registered user accounts"
msgstr "Geplante Löschung abgemeldeter Benutzerkonten"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:524
msgid ""
"You can schedule the script to run regularly. Create a cron job through a"
" UCR variable, as shown in :numref:`end-user-self-service-deregistration-"
"schedule-listing`."
msgstr ""
"Sie können das Skript so planen, dass es regelmäßig läuft. Erstellen Sie "
"einen Cron-Job über eine UCR-Variable, wie in :numref:`end-user-self-"
"service-deregistration-schedule-listing` gezeigt."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:528
msgid "Schedule deletion of de-registered user accounts"
msgstr "Planen Sie die Löschung abgemeldeter Benutzerkonten"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:528
msgid ""
"$ ucr set cron/delete_deregistered_accounts/command=\\\n"
"/usr/share/univention-self-service/delete_deregistered_accounts.py\\\n"
"' --timedelta-days 30'\\\n"
"  cron/delete_deregistered_accounts/time='00 06 * * *'  # daily at 06:00"
msgstr ""
"$ ucr set cron/delete_deregistered_accounts/command=\\\n"
"/usr/share/univention-self-service/delete_deregistered_accounts.py\\\n"
"' --timedelta-days 30'\\\n"
"  cron/delete_deregistered_accounts/time='00 06 * * *'  # täglich um 06:00"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:537
msgid ""
"For more information about how to set cron jobs through UCR variables, "
"see :external+uv-ucs-manual:ref:`computers-defining-cron-jobs-in-"
"univention-configuration-registry`."
msgstr ""
"Für weitere Informationen zum Einrichten von Cron-Jobs über UCR-Variablen"
" siehe :external+uv-ucs-manual:ref:`computers-defining-cron-jobs-in-"
"univention-configuration-registry`."

